			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2101363">
									

<p>I don't think the interview log added anything interesting. Other than that, this is pretty good. It skirted the line of being too &quot;lolrandom&quot; but managed to find that equilibrium of bizarre enough to be unsettling but not laughable. I especially liked the part where the GPS signal was originating from space. To me it felt like the Eldritch dog-eating memetic abomination knows it's been caught and is attempting to ward off its discoverers by giving them faulty coordinates, but is so unfamiliar with how our world works that it doesn't know that the cool misdirection spot isn't actually going to work. The mental picture was pretty fucked up too. And I thought ducks were creepy enough&#8230;<br />
+1</p>

							</div>

